# The Music catalog images build from the repository root (see
# apps/music-catalog/Dockerfile and mbslave.Dockerfile): the monorepo
# workspace they need is part of the build context. Everything else stays
# out of it, so the context is a few megabytes instead of the whole checkout
# (node_modules, .git, the other apps).
*

# What `nub install` needs to resolve the workspace: the root manifest, the
# lockfile and every workspace's manifest (the lockfile lists them all).
!package.json
!nub.lock
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json

# The two packages the Music catalog is built from.
!packages/contracts
!apps/music-catalog

# Inside them: no installed or built output (the image builds its own), no
# local env files, no tests, reports or the production deploy files.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/coverage-e2e
**/reports
**/.stryker-tmp
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/music-catalog/test
apps/music-catalog/deploy
